x factor's tom mann reveals the tragic  news that his fiancee danny hamson died  on their wedding day she was 34. her  cause of death is not yet known  [Music]  [Applause]  the former x factor uk contestant  revealed the heartbreaking news on  instagram alongside a black and white  photo of danny and their son bowie tom  writes quote i can't believe i'm writing  these words but my darling danny my best  friend my everything and more the love  of my life passed away in the early  hours of saturday morning 18th june  on what was supposed to be the happiest  day of our lives ended an irreversible  heartbreak i feel like i have cried an  ocean  we never made it to the altar or got to  say our vows or dance our first dance  but i know you know that you were my  entire world and the best thing that has  ever happened to me danielle  i will wear this ring that i was always  supposed to wear as a sign of my  unconditional love to you  tom made it clear in his message that  he's going to stay strong for their son  and although he admits he's completely  broken he promises danny to raise him  just the way they always wanted quote i  promise you he will know how amazing his  mommy was i promise to make you so so  proud tom also takes a moment to  describe his longtime love calling her  quote the most beautiful person inside  and out the most incredible soul he ends  his post by writing a message directly  to his beloved quote my darling danny  the brightest light in any room my world  is nothing but darkness without you i  will miss you forever  and now a ton of love and support is  flooding in the comments singer louis  capaldi simply writing quote love you  brother ellie golding offering her  condolences quote i'm thinking of you  non-stop you are so strong here for you  always love you  and spice girl emma bunton shares a  similar message quote heartbroken for  you a beautiful soul that will live on  thinking of you all  danny's final post a collage of photos  with tom and baby bowie on a family  vacation in sardinia italy last month  showing family meant everything to her  the couple originally planned to get  married in 2020 but had to postpone  their numptuals due to the pandemic and  when dany wasn't busy being a loving mom  and partner she was working in pr and  also known as a dancer she notably  appeared in harry styles 2021 music  video for treat people with kindness
 

